WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.059
Burnout does not happen in a moment.

2
00:00:03.119 --> 00:00:06.059
It happens in erosion.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.860
If your life is only work and home,

4
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.840
if you only exist to serve other people's agendas, you eventually

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.780
disappear inside your own roles.

6
00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:24.479
You become a high-functioning machine, a robot, part of the system.

7
00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:26.939
Phase three is about identity.

8
00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:30.058
And we are going to build your third place.
